email plus the Admin badge; no `.sidebar-user` node remains. Designer and
Explorer now report an identical sidebar-to-canvas gap of 24px with the canvas
left edge at 80px on both. Attributes tab on Customer at a 620px viewport
reports exactly one scroller, `#sharedPanelBody` (696px of content in 405px),
with the attributes box at `overflow-y: visible`. Business Views entity headers
computed at `rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1)`.

