Tests: `uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario"` -> 5331 passed, 281
skipped, 6 deselected, 1 xfailed, 0 failed in 37.78s.

Browser verification (Playwright, domain Cust360Auto v4): a focused
`.btn-outline-secondary` now measures `background rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)` with
`box-shadow rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.18) 0 0 0 3.2px`, and a focused
`.btn-outline-danger` the same ring while keeping `color rgb(220, 38, 38)` —
previously both filled solid. The KG Cohorts Explain control reports
`10px 0 0 10px` on the input and `0 10px 10px 0` on the button (was 4px). The
Designer header shows nine button groups all rounded 10px on their outer edges
with no `.assistant-fab` node in the DOM. At 390x844 the Domain Audit header
reports zero clipped buttons and a single button height of 31px (was 73px and
52px with clipping); Settings/Lakebase likewise reports 31px with no horizontal
overflow. Graph Chat renders the indigo accent bar, a 10px transparent "Clear
chat" and an indigo send button.

Known, out of scope: at 390px the L2 subnav and breadcrumb strip still overflow
horizontally (`.ob-subnav-item`, `#obBreadcrumbWrap`) — a navbar layout issue,
not a button one.
